<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1242</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>When the corresponding RDA signal cannot be received within 1 seconds after the PRG signal is output from the main body ECU in self-diagnosis mode</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
